msgstr "Este comando carga el módulo llamado nombre-del-módulo desde el directorio de módulos."

#: ../modules/nickserv/ns_group.cpp
msgid ""
"This command makes your nickname join the target nickname's account. password is the password of the target nickname. \n"
"\n"
"Joining an account will allow you to share your configuration, memos, and channel privileges with all the nicknames in the account, and much more!\n"
"\n"
"An account exists as long as it is useful. This means that even if a nick of the account is dropped, you won't lose the shared things described above, as long as there is at least one nick remaining in the account.\n"
"\n"
"You may be able to use this command even if you have not registered your nick yet. If your nick is already registered, you'll need to identify yourself before using this command. \n"
"\n"
"It is recommended to use this command with a non-registered nick because it will be registered automatically when using this command. You may use it with a registered nick (to change your account) only if your network administrators allowed it.\n"
"\n"
"You can only be in one account at a time. Group merging is not possible. \n"
"\n"
"Note: all the nicknames of an account have the same password."
msgstr ""
"Este comando hace que tu nick se una a la cuenta del nick destino. contraseña es la contraseña del nick destino. \n"
"\n"
"¡Unirte a una cuenta te permitirá compartir tu configuración, memos y privilegios de canal con todos los nicks de la cuenta, y mucho más!\n"
"\n"
"Una cuenta existe mientras sea útil. Esto significa que aunque se elimine un nick de la cuenta, no perderás lo compartido descrito arriba, siempre que quede al menos un nick en la cuenta.\n"
"\n"
"Puede que puedas usar este comando aunque aún no hayas registrado tu nick. Si tu nick ya está registrado, tendrás que identificarte antes de usar este comando. \n"
"\n"
"Se recomienda usar este comando con un nick no registrado, ya que se registrará automáticamente al usarlo. Puedes usarlo con un nick registrado (para cambiar de cuenta) solo si los administradores de tu red lo permiten.\n"
"\n"
"Solo puedes estar en una cuenta a la vez. No es posible fusionar grupos. \n"
"\n"
"Nota: todos los nicks de una cuenta tienen la misma contraseña."

